{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2023-06-29 08:00:00', 'title': 'LYONDELLBASELL INVESTS IN CARBON NEUTRALITY VENTURE FUND', 'text': 'ROTTERDAM, NETHERLANDS , JUNE 29, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LYONDELLBASELL (NYSE: LYB) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS INVESTMENT IN A NEW CARBON NEUTRALITY FUND LED BY CHRYSALIX VENTURE CAPITAL. THE FUND WILL SUPPORT EMERGING COMPANIES DEVELOPING AND DEPLOYING NEW LOW-CARBON TECHNOLOGIES, FOCUSING ON HARD-TO-ABATE SECTORS, SUCH AS THE CHEMICALS INDUSTRY.'}